      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kubwaghwa kwa Ishboshethi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishboshethi mwana wa Sauli uendasikira kukaia Abneri wabwaghilo Hebroni, ukafwa ngolo na wandu wose wa Israeli wikangilwa ni kiture. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uo mwana wa Sauli orekoghe na wandu wawi, awo werekoghe wabaa wa majeshi ghake; irina ja umu orewangwagha Baana na uja wa kawi orewangwagha Rekabu; nawo ni wana wa Rimoni mundu wa kivalwa cha Benjamini ufumie Beerothi: (kwa kukaia muzi ghwa Beerothi ghoretaliloghe kukaia muzi ghumu ghwa kivalwa cha Benjamini; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Waberothi werekimbirieghe cha Gitaimu, wikakaia aho kiwughenyi hata linu).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
